class_name Procedures
extends RefCounted
## Every operation in the game as data: its steps, what each step needs
## from Tom's tray, what the doctor does (trace a cut, hold, tap something,
## decide, stitch), what the team says, the time-out board, what can go
## wrong and where things are inside. OperationTask plays any of them.
##
## Lines can name the patient with {name}, and use {he}, {He}, {his}, {His},
## {him} and {Him}, so one complication reads right for any patient. {called}
## is how the team addresses the doctor.
##
## Skin positions are centimetres in a 20 by 14 window, as in OperationTask.

## What can go wrong in any operation. A procedure lists which of these it
## can roll ("pool") and may change their lines ("lines").
